pecific patches.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 4, \"reason\": \"Does not state a bus factor number or any shares for Hartley or the top two combined. No 63-71% figure appears.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 5, \"reason\": \"Names Nathaniel as unresponsive, but does not mention Delgan and gives no share of lines owned by departed people.\", \"pass\": false}], \"C\": [{\"n\": 1, \"reason\": \"Names Dana Kessler as top at 44% and Hartley at 29%, so Hartley is out of the 51-59% range, and Dana is named top owner.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 2, \"reason\": \"Dana is presented as the largest author at 44%, although it flags that 1,103 of her lines are vendored. Excluding that, it still says about 11%, which is at or above 10%, so it fails.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 3, \"reason\": \"Priya is mentioned only as having made two commits and is not credited with a line count. Tomas Ibarra is not mentioned.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 4, \"reason\": \"States project-level bus factor is about 2, and not 1. It also says Hartley plus Dana account for 73% rather than Hartley plus Arnon.\", \"pass\": false}, {\"n\": 5, \"reason\": \"Describes Arnon Yaari as inactive since 2022, which is wrong because he is active. Delgan is marked 'Unknown' rather than departed, and no departed-share figure of 25-35% is given.\", \"pass\": false}]}","ttft_ms":11289,"type":"result","duration_ms":11306,"uuid":"2fd4287b-fd68-497e-ae7f-26b4c9ec10a6","ttft_stream_ms":1850,"time_to_request_ms":449,"first_content_frame_ms":1851,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
